msgid ""
"One ZIP file with all the records (to put back into this system) and the "
"same data as Excel and CSV (to open or move into any other program). It "
"takes a few minutes at most, even with thousands of patients."
msgstr ""
"ملف ZIP واحد فيه كل السجلات (لإرجاعها إلى هذا النظام)، ونفس البيانات بصيغة "
